+# Test Design: STORY-322 — Loader Health Dashboard
+
+## Test Files
+
+1. **`e2e/loaders-dashboard.spec.ts`** — Playwright E2E spec (16 tests) covering all SC-6 requirements + role gating + polling.
+2. **`dashboard/src/pages/LoadersPage.test.ts`** — 23 source-analysis tests using `node:test` + `node:assert/strict` for structural verification.
+
+## Coverage Map
+
+| SC | E2E Tests | Source Tests | What's Asserted |
+|----|-----------|-------------|-----------------|
+| SC-1 | 1 (renders cards) | 3 | `LoadersPage.tsx` exists, exports `LoadersPage`, imports `LoaderHealthCard` |
+| SC-2 | 4 (colors, circuit_state, staleness, failures) | 6 | Health badge colors (green/yellow/red), `staleness_seconds`, `circuit_state`, `consecutive_failures`, `last_success_at` |
+| SC-3 | 5 (modal open, validate empty, validate whitespace, submit payload, enable on valid) | 5 | Modal opens, reason field required, `trim()` validation, POST to `/api/loaders/{name}/reset-circuit`, payload `{ reason: string }` |
+| SC-4 | 1 (polling fires) | 1 | 30000ms polling interval (30s) |
+| SC-5 | 1 (non-admin denied) | 5 | `PermissionGuard` wraps route with `pageKey="loaders"`, nav item in Layout.tsx |
+| SC-6 | 2 (empty state) | 1 | Render 0 loaders with user-friendly message, no cards rendered |
+| SC-7 | 0 (implicit) | 2 | `client.ts` uses `/healthz` + `/api/loaders/*`, `src/api/loaders.py` unchanged (2 Route() defs) |
+
+**Total: 16 E2E + 23 source-analysis = 39 tests**
+
+## E2E Test Structure (Playwright)
+
+```
+e2e/loaders-dashboard.spec.ts
+  Loaders Dashboard — Empty State
+    - displays empty state message when no loaders are registered
+    - does not render any loader cards when registry is empty
+  Loaders Dashboard — Mixed Colors
+    - renders one card per registered loader
+    - displays green, yellow, and red health badges for mixed loaders
+    - shows circuit_state for each loader
+    - shows staleness_seconds for healthy loaders
+    - shows consecutive_failures count
+    - shows Reset Circuit button only for open-circuit loaders
+  Loaders Dashboard — Reset Circuit Modal
+    - opens reset modal when Reset Circuit button is clicked
+    - disables submit when reason field is empty
+    - enables submit when a non-empty reason is provided
+    - POST /api/loaders/{name}/reset-circuit with correct payload shape
+    - rejects empty reason with validation before sending POST
+  Loaders Dashboard — Polling
+    - polls /healthz at 30-second intervals
+  Loaders Dashboard — Role Gating
+    - denies access to non-admin users
+```
+
+## Mock Strategy
+
+All E2E tests use Playwright `page.route()` to intercept API calls:
+- `/healthz` — returns mock `loaders_registry` block with configurable loaders
+- `/api/loaders/{name}/status` — returns per-loader health snapshot
+- `/api/loaders/{name}/reset-circuit` — captures POST payload for assertion
+- `/api/permissions/my-access` — toggleable admin/non-admin responses
+- `/api/config`, `/api/health`, `/api/mcp-token/status` — mock responses for Layout dependencies
+
+## RED State Verification
+
+**Source-analysis tests (node:test):**
+```
+# tests 23
+# pass 1      (SC-7 backend unchanged — expected baseline)
+# fail 22     (all AssertionError — correct RED)
