+
+**E2E tests (Playwright):**
+All 16 tests in RED — no `LoadersPage.tsx`, `LoaderHealthCard.tsx`, or `ResetCircuitModal.tsx` exist yet. Tests will timeout or fail on missing elements.
+
+## Run Commands
+
+```bash
+# Source-analysis tests
+cd dashboard && npx tsx --test src/pages/LoadersPage.test.ts
+
+# E2E tests (requires dev server)
+npx playwright test e2e/loaders-dashboard.spec.ts
+```
+
+## Phase 8 Expectations
+
+Implement:
+1. `dashboard/src/pages/LoadersPage.tsx` — page with 30s polling, empty state, grid of cards
+2. `dashboard/src/components/LoaderHealthCard.tsx` — card with health badge, staleness, circuit state, failures, last_success_at, rows_loaded
+3. `dashboard/src/components/ResetCircuitModal.tsx` — reason-required modal with `trim()` validation, disabled submit on empty
+4. `dashboard/src/api/client.ts` — add `fetchLoadersHealth()` (from `/healthz`) + `resetLoaderCircuit(name, reason)` (POST)
+5. `dashboard/src/App.tsx` — add `/loaders` route with `PermissionGuard pageKey="loaders"`
+6. `dashboard/src/components/Layout.tsx` — add nav item `{ to: "/dashboard/loaders", label: "Loaders", icon: "...", pageKey: "loaders" }`
+7. Add `data-testid="loader-health-card"` to each card for E2E selector stability
